      "semantics": [
        "Equivalent to self.conv_transpose(x) using cuDNN ConvTranspose1d with exactly the given stride, padding, output_padding.",
        "Input x [N,C_in,L], weight [C_in,C_out,kernel_size], bias [C_out], output [N,C_out,L_out].",
        "L_out = (L-1)*stride - 2*padding + kernel_size + output_padding = (16384-1)*2 - 2*1 + 3 + 1 = 32768."
